#EXTM3U
# Internet radio stations for evo-esp32: copy this folder to the
# card and the stations appear in the library under Radio. One
# #EXTINF line names the station on the URL line below it; add or
# remove as you like, or put your own .m3u or .pls files here.
#
# These are the stations Volumio's own selection lists (October
# 2026); the streams are their broadcasters'. What the player
# decodes: MP3, FLAC, Ogg Vorbis and AAC-LC. HE-AAC (aacp) streams
# play at reduced quality.

